{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"My mother, she aint none to kind of folk outside our lands, I'm afraid I cant go back.\" He pauses. And whipes the tear from his cheek. \"Do you know what happened to Eldon? I have his things here with me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T12:41:40.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865211515493285918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"A mother will love their child no matter the form.... thats what separates them from the person feeling obliged to raise you\" he pauses \"and Emden hasn't been back in a day or so\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T12:43:19.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865211930209157132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(Last year being an orphan made things easy... Living family though... Hadnt thought of that XD)","created_at":"2021-07-15T12:43:20.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865211937716305921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
